# 🤖 AI Face Puzzle Game

## 📌 Overview
This project demonstrates how AI can be used to build an interactive face puzzle game using Claude. The application transforms a user's face into a movable puzzle grid, allowing players to rearrange shuffled pieces and complete the original image.

The objective is to explore AI-assisted application development while combining image processing, game logic, and an engaging user interface.

---

## 🚀 Features

- Upload a facial image
- Automatic puzzle generation
- Adjustable puzzle difficulty
- Drag-and-drop tile movement
- Shuffle and reset functionality
- Move counter
- Completion detection
- Responsive user interface
- AI-assisted game logic with Claude

---

## 🛠️ Workflow

### Step 1
Upload a facial image.

### Step 2
The application detects and prepares the image.

### Step 3
The image is divided into puzzle tiles.

### Step 4
Tiles are randomly shuffled.

### Step 5
The player rearranges tiles using drag-and-drop interactions.

### Step 6
The application checks puzzle completion and displays success once solved.

